<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LVClass LVVersion="23008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Scan Driver is a simple application that configures arbitrary Scannable and Readable Instruments and then scans over them to generate a graph of data.  It interfaces with all major classes in this project: Instrument, Scannable, Readable, Scanner, Reader, and File IO.

File IO is a friend of Scan Driver so that it can access member fields and write them to a file.</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.FriendGUID" Type="Str">872c9b5d-f3c8-4953-8075-be35a2276f04</Property>
